#: ../../changelog/arduino-rpc/index.rst:4
msgid "OpenMV Arduino RPC Library Changelog"
msgstr "Changelog OpenMV Arduino RPC Library"

#: ../../changelog/arduino-rpc/index.rst:6
msgid ""
"The OpenMV Arduino RPC library lets an Arduino control an OpenMV Cam — and "
"stream data from it — over CAN, I²C, SPI, UART (async serial), and USB. It "
"is robust and fault tolerant, recovering automatically from loose wires, "
"packet corruption, and timeouts. Here's what changed in each release — "
"newest first."
msgstr ""
"Met de OpenMV Arduino RPC-library kan een Arduino een OpenMV Cam aansturen —"
" en er data van streamen — via CAN, I²C, SPI, UART (asynchrone seriële "
"verbinding) en USB. De library is robuust en fouttolerant en herstelt "
"automatisch van losse draden, pakketcorruptie en time-outs. Hier lees je wat"
" er in elke release is veranderd — nieuwste eerst."
